{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_11103160","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11103160","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1110316001:1":{"text":"군가 축제에서 우르 부족이 패배한 걸 인정하는가?","source_cn":"不甘心吗？你会接受吗，乌尔氏族在战歌节的失败？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2AE3D0845E23AF27","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1110316002:0":{"text":"전... 인정할 수 없어요! 하지만 공정한 전투에서 제가 브루투스 님을 이길 수 없다는 건 인정해요.","source_cn":"我——我不甘心！但必须承认，这是公平的战斗，我无法战胜您……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE0DC10DCACE8E818","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1110316003:0":{"text":"알겠네. 그렇다면, 우르 부족의 영혼의 시련은...","source_cn":"我明白了，那么，乌尔氏族的魂之试炼……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA4A099BC5C565D5D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:8:1110317001:":{"text":"잠시만요! ","source_cn":"等等！请等一下！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x54CA9845BD7CC21B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:8:1110317002:":{"text":"늦어서 죄송해요!","source_cn":"不好意思，我来迟了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD5B42E2D5D0B76A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:8:1110317003:":{"text":"아르사! 너...","source_cn":"阿尔萨，你……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9B802EBB51ED4278","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1110316004:1":{"text":"브루투스 님, 보시다시피 우르 부족의 대표는 두 명입니다!","source_cn":"布鲁特斯大人，如您所见，乌尔氏族的代表是两个人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5B85BF04A8CC7B27","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1110316005:1":{"text":"저희에게... 다시 한 번 기회를 주시겠어요?","source_cn":"您看，我们……可以再得到一次试炼的机会吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8FDB0888BB4F9ED1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1110316006:1":{"text":"군가 축제의 규칙에는 이런 상황을 다루고 있진 않지. 즉, 재량권은 내게 있는데...","source_cn":"战歌节的规则并没有涵盖你们这种情况。也就是说，裁量权在我——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFE2BCB668EFD6E13","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1110316007:1":{"text":"하지만, 좋아. 두 사람이 최선을 다하는 모습을 보여주게!","source_cn":"不过，我同意。让我看看你们两个人拼尽全力的样子吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE2E25F04C0635CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:16:11010103:0":{"text":"브루투스가 시련 실패를 선언하려는 순간, 아르사가 나타났다.","source_cn":"就在布鲁特斯即将宣布试炼失败时，阿尔萨出现了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x355CC91D2CBD3180","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:布鲁特斯":{"text":"브루투스","source":"布鲁特斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:索恩":{"text":"소렌","source":"索恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:阿尔萨":{"text":"아르사","source":"阿尔萨","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:黑屏字幕":{"text":"블랙 스크린 자막","source":"黑屏字幕","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":16,"localized_text_count":11,"speaker_count":4}}